OL,3,GNEWSAWhat proposed speed controls could
OL,4,Amean for residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority has asked residents
OL,7,Fand businesses to share their views on
OL,8,Fplans to bring in lower speed limits.
OL,10,FGloucestershire County Council is
OL,11,Fproposing to reduce limits on roads in
OL,12,FTewkesbury and surrounding areas where
OL,13,Fsafety is a concern, with a public
OL,14,Fconsultation now open.
OL,16,FCouncillor Roger Whyborn, cabinet
OL,17,Fmember for sustainable transport and
OL,18,Froad safety, says the plans are aimed
OL,19,Fat "reducing speeds where it matters
OL,20,Fmost, helping to prevent collisions and
OL,21,Fcreating environments where people feel
OL,22,Fsafer".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
