OL,3,GNEWSAWhat proposed speed controls could
OL,4,Amean for residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhyborn said he wanted to hear from
OL,7,Fresidents so the council could
OL,8,F"understand their views" and make sure
OL,9,Fplans reflected "the needs of
OL,10,FTewkesbury and the surrounding areas".
